## Interface: 30300
## Title: WotLK Plus
## Notes: WotLK 3.3.5 quality-of-life, banking, sorting, and interface tools. Ascension extensions activate only when their APIs are present.
## Author: Codex
## Version: 0.15.0
## OptionalDeps: ChocolateBar, ElvUI, Bagnon, AdiBags, AscendedSkillCards
## SavedVariables: WotLKPlusDB, AscensionPlusDB

# Keep the bootstrap and slash registrar first so commands survive feature errors.
